meta {
  name: Cleanup — delete dataset shell
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/datasets/{{importedDataSetId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

tests {
  test("dataset shell removed", function() {
    expect([200, 204]).to.include(res.status);
  });
}

docs {
  Best-effort cleanup: the dataset shell from 04 is deleted via the regular
  CRUD endpoint. The imported structures stay (DRAFT, run-unique URNs) —
  deleting them safely involves the version/registry pin and is left to the
  portal UI for now. Same for the mapping artifact from 07: deleting the
  datasets only drops the manifest membership, not the mapping itself.
}
